  "audio": null,
  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-C6-LCD-1.28). The repo's BSP and 07_LVGL_Demo are copied from the ESP32-C6-Touch-LCD-1.28 and declare a CST816S touch (RST GPIO23, INT GPIO4); this board has no touch panel - the schematic has no touch connector, HARDWARE_REFERENCE.md says GPIO23 is BC_State (charge status) and GPIO4 is QMI8658 INT2.",
